How to run each macro

g++ -std=c++17 file_name.cc -o file_name $(root-config --cflags --libs)
./file_name

FakeDataUnfolder_file_plotter.cc // file to create final 1-bin xsec plot
Unfolder_file_plotter.cc // file to create final 1-bin xsec plot

mastbaum_ntuple_plotter.cc // holds the predictions for other generators that I compare the 1-bin xsec to

MicroBooNE_1bin_Prediction.cc // microboone tune prediction

EventSelectionCutPlotter.cc (for event level plots)

Secondary_Proton_ES_Plots.cc (for PFP level plots)





